Description: Add standalone Sony IMX681 support to libcamera Simple IPA
 The standalone SP11 kernel driver exposes Sony's reciprocal analogue-gain
 code in the range 0..960. Add the corresponding sensor helper, the measured
 unit-cell/control-delay metadata, and conservative model-named tuning with
 the hardware-measured 64-code RAW10 black pedestal. Leave colour correction
 disabled until a controlled chart measurement establishes a real matrix.
Origin: other, https://github.com/turbineBMW/surface-pro-11-linux/tree/main/userspace/libcamera
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-08-29
